// test-seed-sample: runs the REAL seed and wipe SQL (generated by the Python scripts) on replayed migrations.
//
//   npm run test:seed
//
// LOCAL AND IN-MEMORY ONLY. PGlite in this process, no database URL, no key, no network: it cannot reach
// Ohvara's live database. A pass is on a stand-in for Supabase built from the migration files, so triggers that
// exist only on live don't show here; section 2 of qa/servicing-seed/door-dry-run.sql lists those.
//
// Prints one PASS or FAIL line per check, with the id trigger-audit.md cites. Exit code 0 only if all pass.
